	<string>JeroPay needs access to your photo library so you can upload a profile picture or identity verification documents.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>JeroPay uses your location to help detect and prevent fraudulent transactions and to show services available in your area.</string>
